---
title: Edge Types Demo
layout: tree-down
hSpacing: 200
---

# Demonstrating different edge types
a [rect] "Node A"
b [rect] "Node B"
c [rect] "Node C"
d [rect] "Node D"
e [rect] "Node E"

# Straight arrow (default)
a -> b "arrow (->)"

# Plain line (no arrowhead)
a -- c "line (--)"

# Bezier curve
b ~> d "bezier (~>)"

# Elbow connector
c => e "elbow (=>)"
